  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID - ATIC ICT Excellence Center Tekwill 2016-2023 - ICT Excellence Center ICTEC/Tekwill</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">USAID - ATIC ICT Excellence Center Tekwill 2016-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal is to enhance the competitiveness of the ICT sector in the Republic of Moldova by creating a viable ICT entrepreneurship ecosystem.

Project Outcomes:
1. To make a significant impact on Moldovan economy by accelerating the growth of IT industry and creating new well-paid jobs;
2. Triple Moldovas IT export potential over five years through contributing to the development of the SME sector and creating a favourable environment for entrepreneurship development;
3. To further improve Moldovas image and put Moldova on the map as a world-class center for IT innovation and entrepreneurship; 
4. To increase the competitiveness of the ICT sector and the economy as a whole, through knowledge sharing and forging viable partnerships abroad;
5. To create premises for more young people to choose and IT-related career, in particular girls and women, through early stage support, skills development and entrepreneurship;
6. Link the Moldovan IT Community to global resources.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID and the Moldovan Association of ICT Companies have applied to the Embassy of Sweden for funding of 17,010 MSEK to co-finance a project related to the establishment of an ICT Excellence Center during the period 2016-2019. 
The intervention aims at enhancing the competitiveness of the Moldovan ICT industry through the creation of an ICT Excellence Center, which is supposed to fill in the gap between the industry needs and the offer of the Technical University by improving the quality of labor force.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">USAID och Moldovan Association of ICT Companies (ATIC) har inkommit med en ans&#xf6;kan till ambassaden om finansering av 17,010 MSEK f&#xf6;r att gemensamt finansiera ett projekt f&#xf6;r att etablera ett utbildningcenter f&#xf6;r ICT-sektorn i Moldavien (ICT Excellence Center) under perioden 2016-2019.
Insatsen har som m&#xe5;l att &#xf6;ka konkurrenskraften av ICT-industrin i Moldavien genom att s&#xe4;tta upp ett ICT Excellence Center f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;verbrygga den klyfta som finns mellan den kompetens som industrin har behov av och den utbildning som utf&#xf6;rs av Moldavien Tekniska Universitet.</narrative>
  </description>
